		{
			String _name = "HuoshanTip";
			String _text = "A continent of ancient times.Please choose the best terrain with more plains.Because living near the St.Valcano,so people in this area live up to 60,and they have children from 10 to 50 years old，but the people have faster speed and handling capacity,therefore you do not introduce the refugees.The game started out St.Valcano neighbourhood,and the St.Valcano canbless the curse tool as a holy tool(It can be used for ever by someone).";
		}
